## Set verbs: operations whose input and output are whole geometry sets, for
## the families mesh verbs do not cover (curves, SDFs, volumes, splats) and for the
## conversions between families. A set verb is described like a mesh verb
## (the same ParmSpec rows, Group and Group Type), so the node catalog is one
## generator over both registries (api.lucb's VerbCatalog). Generators take no
## input; some verbs take a second set (a profile, a boolean's other operand).
